"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 that middle ran 27% of normal in January to February 2025 and 179% in June to July 2025. Every grid had its driest year in 1988, and grid 25344 got just 50% of normal in 1988.</p>"}
